The user interface is designed to provide a simple, responsive, and user-friendly experience. It includes input fields, buttons, navigation elements, status messages, and result sections. The frontend communicates with the FastAPI backend through REST API requests. Form validation and error messages are included to help users enter correct information and understand the system response.

